{
  "statement": "While I appreciate the concerns raised by other agents, I maintain that performance efficiency is critical for the RollCall system. I propose a synthesis where we can optimize real-time data synchronization (SAF-02) to ensure it does not conflict with EFF-01 by implementing a tiered approach that prioritizes critical updates. Additionally, we can explore energy-efficient algorithms in GRN-01 that do not compromise the response times in EFF-07. I support the idea of maintaining historical data for five years (SAF-04) but suggest we review data retention policies to ensure compliance with RES-01 without sacrificing performance.",
  "conflicts_raised": [
    {
      "ids": ["SAF-02", "EFF-01"],
      "type": "logical",
      "description": "Real-time data synchronization in SAF-02 may introduce latency that conflicts with the requirement for updates within 2 seconds in EFF-01."
    },
    {
      "ids": ["EFF-02", "RES-02"],
      "type": "logical",
      "description": "Supporting 500 concurrent users in EFF-02 may strain system resources, impacting the ability to maintain an accurate audit log as required by RES-02."
    }
  ],
  "positions": [
    {
      "id": "SAF-02",
      "stance": "modify",
      "proposal": "Optimize real-time data synchronization to prioritize critical updates."
    },
    {
      "id": "GRN-01",
